// `Count`, `Sum`, `Max`, `Min` over a `Foreach`; `Max` and `Min` of nothing are 0.
Fact x Identified by 1..5.
?(Sum(Foreach x: x) == 15).
?(Count(Foreach x: x) == 5).
?(Max(Foreach x: x) == 5).
?(Min(Foreach x: x) == 1).
Fact y Identified by Int.
?(Max(Foreach y: y) == 0).
?(Min(Foreach y: y) == 0).
?(Count(Foreach y: y) == 0).
